Subject: [PATCH] Assume that mod_device is global

Otherwise the app tries to start a custom permissions dialog which has
dependencies on the HyperOS Security Center app.

Ported from myron's 0001; z7/c -> Td/c under songyuan's R8 mapping, same
static field m.
